Here is the commit message:
AMBARI-20712 - Parallel Requests With Intersecting Hosts
 Don't Block Correctly (jonathanhurley)

Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by the system not correctly handling parallel requests that involved intersecting hosts, leading to blocking behavior when commands that should run in the background were executed. This resulted in commands being improperly queued, preventing efficient execution of tasks across hosts.

Here is the patch:
